cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the article it implements (see preferred-citation) and, for the specific software version used, the software entry below."
type: software
title: "PSR Biosafety Assessment Tool"
abstract: >-
  Interactive, bilingual (English/Spanish) digital implementation of the
  8-step Procedure-Specific Risk (PSR) framework for biosafety level (BSL)
  assignment in modern biotechnology laboratories. Includes a standalone
  quick-assessment tool, a multi-user assessment platform with persistent
  local storage, and a data analytics module with formal Cohen's kappa /
  Fleiss' kappa inter-rater reliability analysis.
